      "original_pointer": "/exercises/6",
      "original_question": "7. 为了作出透镜的成像图，利用什么光线为宜？",
      "question_text_sha256": "96323e221986af235028e03be7d15a352f3753e8e77f4e72e9547aa09550585d",
      "source_number": "7",
      "group_id": "g1",
      "pages": [
        "p0206#10"
      ],
      "original_figure_refs": [],
      "raw_pointer": "/solutions/6",
      "raw_status": "INDEPENDENT_RAW_CONDITIONAL_NOT_APPROVED",
      "locales": {
        "zh": {
          "prompt_file": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/00b1/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d610-n77-first-written-answer-author/zh/exercises.template.json",
          "prompt_pointer": "/exercises/6/text",
          "source_snapshot_pointer": "/source/data/exercises/6",
          "answer_file": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/00b1/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d610-n77-first-written-answer-author/zh/answer-keys.candidate.json",
          "answer_pointer": "/answers/6/displayAnswer",
          "prompt": "7. 为了作出透镜的成像图，利用什么光线为宜？",
          "prompt_sha256": "96323e221986af235028e03be7d15a352f3753e8e77f4e72e9547aa09550585d",
          "displayAnswer": "对会聚薄透镜，三种便利光线是：\n1. 平行于主光轴入射的光线，折射后通过像方焦点。\n2. 入射前通过物方焦点的光线，折射后平行于主光轴。\n3. 通过光心的光线，在薄透镜近似中方向不变。\n通常选两条独立光线确定像点：实际折射线相交得到实像，反向延长线相交得到虚像。\n发散透镜的平行入射线折射后的反向延长线通过像方虚焦点；射向出射侧相应焦点的入射线则平行出射。\n物点在主光轴上时，三条特殊光线可能重合，应另选一条非轴向光线，利用像方焦平面作图，不能把同一条线当作两条独立光线。",
          "display_answer_sha256": "e68e95c43f55a9ce313a850c29ae7fc3959476c6cdb29c744c7c83a321e980af",
          "source": "derived",
          "grading": "ungraded",
          "parts": []
        },
        "en": {
          "prompt_file": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/00b1/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d610-n77-first-written-answer-author/en/exercises.template.json",
          "prompt_pointer": "/exercises/6/text",
          "source_snapshot_pointer": "/source/data/exercises/6",
          "answer_file": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/00b1/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d610-n77-first-written-answer-author/en/answer-keys.candidate.json",
          "answer_pointer": "/answers/6/displayAnswer",
          "prompt": "7. Which rays are convenient for constructing an image formed by a lens?",
          "prompt_sha256": "c08bbb1b9fa7f5dd1e52dec3b6c41b14b6442c5e9a69aa6aadf3963413a5216b",
          "displayAnswer": "For a converging thin lens, three convenient rays are:\n1. A ray incident parallel to the principal axis, which refracts through the image-side focus.\n2. A ray passing through the object-side focus before the lens, which emerges parallel to the principal axis.\n3. A ray through the optical center, whose direction is unchanged in the thin-lens approximation.\nUsually two independent rays locate the image point: actual refracted rays intersect for a real image, while backward extensions intersect for a virtual image.\nFor a diverging lens, the backward extension of a refracted parallel-incident ray passes through the image-side virtual focus; an incident ray aimed at the corresponding focus on the outgoing side emerges parallel.\nFor an object point on the principal axis, the three special rays may coincide. Choose another nonaxial ray and use the image-side focal plane; the same line is not two independent rays.",
          "display_answer_sha256": "8f595ec40795d0245aef61a91e78620f708e54debc45e48271dee5e4a51a49eb",
          "source": "derived",
          "grading": "ungraded",
          "parts": []
        }
      }
